    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Retry a failure, report a decision",
      "items": [
        "A crash, timeout or empty output is a machine failure (stalled) - worth retrying",
        "A triage needs-maintainer, refine questions, or merge-gate review is a verdict - retrying reproduces it"
      ]
