    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Safe to leave running unattended",
      "items": [
        "Uses the App token, because GitHub starts no workflow run from GITHUB_TOKEN",
        "Every write goes through one act() wrapper with dry-run",
        "Closes exactly two kinds of issue: split parents and its own digest"
